      "updated_at": "2019-04-09T10:37:43Z",
      "body": "Even though the issue you describe exists, I think there is no connection to EU privacy law (GDPR) cause this data is solely stored on user device and has no connection OsmAnd company. Software provided AS IS and it is hard to predict how it will be used on user device, so user should take separate precautions to avoid leak i.e. don't install 3rd party apps, use special security. \r\n\r\nI will vote against this issue cause it seriously harms usability between apps which user can control.",
