      "created_at": "2019-04-10T21:38:13Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-04-10T21:38:13Z",
      "body": "There are \"Data collectors\" and \"Data processors\" in that case the phone is \"Data collector\" and \"Data processor\" cause the data doesn't leave the phone, so it is responsibility of the phone owner. OsmAnd company didn't take that data and didn't store, so it could not be responsible for it. Our Privacy policy only covers information which is processed in any form by the servers owned by us. \r\n\r\nAnyway I need to consult but it would be very stupid to make all Editors with Save As functionality legally responsible how the data stored. \r\n\r\nThis issue is anyway doesn't make sense since Android 7 when applications don't have permission to access all files on the sd card.",
